{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_178_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"一、二十有八年，春，無冰。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"二、夏，衞石惡出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"三、邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"四、秋，八月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"五、仲孫羯如晉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"六、冬，齊慶豐來奔。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"七、十有一月，公如楚。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"八、十有二月，甲寅，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_178_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_178","textTraditional":"九、乙未，楚子昭卒。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}